    "scenesThatPass": [
      "DOROTHY: Don't. It's horrible.\nMIMI: Nonsense! She got at she deserved.",
      "DOROTHY: That's the truth.\nDOROTHY: This is awful of me -- to make a nuisance of myself.\nNORA: Don't be a dope. Have a drink?\nDOROTHY: No thanks.",
      "MIMI: All right, then -- I'll tell them who did do it!\nDOROTHY: Mother!\nMIMI: And I'll give then proof!",
      "DOROTHY: Go away!\nDOROTHY: Go away!\nNORA: Sleuthing isn't all fun, is it? I feel so sorry for that poor girl -",
      "DOROTHY: Oh, Andy, Andy!\nNORA: You'd better take her home. Your home."
    ]
  },
